```
A flat minimalist vector icon of a Philippine Eagle in flight 
silhouetted against a geometric Mt. Apo peak. Clean two-color 
palette: deep forest green (#1B4332) and warm gold (#C9A84C). 
No gradients, no shadows. Suitable for an LGU municipal seal or 
government tourism letterhead. Style: flat vector, geometric, 
professional.
```
Style Constraints to follow:
Colors: Forest green `#1B4332` + gold `#C9A84C` only
Style: Flat vector — no gradients, no drop shadows
Subject: Philippine Eagle + Mt. Apo silhouette (symbols of Davao Region identity)
Use case: LGU memo headers, GitHub portfolio banner, tourism brief cover page
---
